+          <t indent="0" pn="section-a.1.1-6">The solicited node's IPv6/NBMA driver will be passed the Neighbor Advertisement and the soliciting node's link-layer address from the IPv6 network layer.  It will then follow the steps described in section section 4.4.1 to send the NA message to the soliciting node. This will create a pt-pt VC between the solicited node and soliciting node if one did not already exist.</t>
