         <section anchor="performing-router-discovery" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-a.1.2">
           <name slugifiedName="name-performing-router-discovery">Performing Router Discovery</name>
-          <t indent="0" pn="section-a.1.2-1">Router Discovery is described in [7]. To support Router Discovery an
-IPv6 router will join the IPv6 all-routers multicast group address.
